OL,3,GNEWSANewcastle changes badge for first
OL,4,Atime since 1988
OL,5,
OL,6,FNewcastle United has unveiled its new
OL,7,Fbadge as the club changes its crest for
OL,8,Fthe first time since 1988.
OL,10,FThe club spent more than two years
OL,11,Fconsulting with fans, who made it clear
OL,12,Fin research they did not want the crest
OL,13,Fto be completely redesigned, after
OL,14,FNewcastle United said the emblem's
OL,15,Fprevious design was too intricate to
OL,16,Freproduce digitally.
OL,18,FThe club's chief executive David
OL,19,FHopkinson said the crest came from
OL,20,FNewcastle's coat of arms but still
OL,21,Fhonoured "where we have come from".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
