OL,3,GNEWSANewcastle changes badge for first
OL,4,Atime since 1988
OL,5,
OL,6,FNewcastle players will wear the crest
OL,7,Ffor the first time on the pitch in the
OL,8,Fclub's final home game of the season
OL,9,Fagainst Crystal Palace in May.
